@startuml
title GoBGP speaker restart | bounded Operator Type-2 fixture contract
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFD
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #2F5D7C
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #EAF4FF

actor "Test runner" as T
participant "k8gobgp provider\nconfiguration / DaemonSet" as K
participant "Node-Agent\nType-2 loops" as A
database "Original export /\nimport journals" as J
participant "GoBGP\nUnix peer / RIB" as G
participant "FRR peer + OVN/OVS\npacket path" as P

== Record original ownership ==
T -> A : collect fresh export status and speaker incarnation
T -> K : retain BGPConfiguration UID / spec / generation
A -> J : exact acknowledged export UUID receipts

== Replace speaker; keep agent and journals ==
T -> K : delete exact provider Pod; wait for new Pod
K -> G : launch replacement managed gobgpd
A -> G : reconnect to actual Unix peer;\nverify process and provider attestation
alt current identity and authoritative recovery evidence valid
  A -> J : reconcile old-incarnation receipts under recovery gates
  A -> G : re-advertise eligible local Type-2 paths
  G --> A : fresh acknowledged path UUIDs
  A -> J : commit new receipts; do not transfer old UUID authority
  G -> P : BGP EVPN Type-2 updates
  A -> G : fresh complete stable remote RIB observations
  A -> A : reconcile receipt-owned Netlink integration state
else failed attestation, incomplete reads or ownership conflict
  A -> A : explicit blocked/error status; freeze unsafe mutations
end

== Independent runner checks ==
T -> A : newer RUNNING status; changed speaker identity;\n4 fresh UUIDs disjoint from old set; 1 imported route
T -> K : assert unchanged configuration UID / spec / generation
T -> P : verify received local route and captured\nbidirectional OVN/OVS VXLAN traffic
P --> T : packet attribution, not just Established BGP

== Later endpoint retirement and cleanup ==
T -> A : normal CNI endpoint retirement
A -> G : DeletePath exact current owned UUIDs
G -> P : BGP withdrawal for retired endpoint
T -> P : verify exact absence and surviving routes / traffic
T -> T : drain owned state; perform guarded fixture cleanup

legend bottom center
  Speaker replacement is distinct from agent restart and combined restart.
  This explains implemented checks, not a service-availability guarantee.
endlegend
@enduml
